!!!Lojban Archives Project

((Lojbanic Community Links|#Lojbanic_People|Bob LeChevalier)) is serving as project leader of the Lojban Archives Project.  He collects any and all Loglan and Lojban materials that people send them, thus serving as a historical repository for the language development and growth. He also uses the material to research and respond to questions about the history of the Loglan Project, and the intentions of JCB and the early developers of Lojban; if you have any such questions please e-mail him.

~hc~ #END#PROJECT# ~/hc~
